}]]></Value>
    </blockList>
    <description>
      <Value><![CDATA[We need your help. British Pathe has a collection of archive material which shows, among others, stoolball photos and film clips dated 1940 and 1951, which make very interesting viewing. We want to know who is in the clips.]]></Value>
    </description>
